  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="70.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 70.1</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="70.1" corresp="#wit-g-a">Ac beo be his dihte seo æht gescyft swyðe rihte wife ⁊ cildu<hi rend="italic">m</hi> ⁊ nehmagu<hi rend="italic">m</hi>, ælcu<hi rend="italic">m</hi> be þære mæðe, þe hi<hi rend="italic">m</hi> to gebyrige.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="70.1" corresp="#wit-a">Ac beo be his dihte seo æht gescyft swiðe rihte wife ⁊ cildan ⁊ nehmagon, ælcum be þære mæðe, þe him to gebyrige.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="70.1" corresp="#wit-q">Sed sit secundum dictionem eius ipsa pecunia recte diuisa uxori, pueris, propinquis, unicuique secundum modum, qui ad eum pertinet.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="70.1" corresp="#wit-b">Ac beo be his dihte seo æht gescyft swyðe rihte wife ⁊ cildan ⁊ neahmagon, ælcon be ðære mæðe ðe him to gebyrige.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-b">But, according to his direction, the property shall be very strictly divided among his wife and children and near kinsmen, each according to the share which belongs to him.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Vielmehr werde unter seiner Anordnung die Habe höchst gerecht vertheilt an Ehefrau und Kinder und nahe Verwandte, jedem nach dem Maass, das ihm gebührt.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">Rather, let the property be distributed, under his direction, most justly to wife and children and near kinsmen, to each according to the measure that is due to him.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
